# Local briefs stay untracked; the scheduled workflow force-adds them in CI.
reports/*.md
# Generated weekly briefs are noise; eval and smoke reports are evidence and
# are committed - every number in the README has to trace back to one.
!reports/eval-investigations-*.md
!reports/smoke-*.md
!reports/.gitkeep
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
